	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Plures hisce diebus literas <placeName ref="l157">Francfordiam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sunt scribendae, frater charissime.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Te itaque oro, ut <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>breviusculis his sis contentus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Recepi tuas <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ac prudenter te facere iudico, qui legato regio <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>te non nimis familiarem facias; quia tamen <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>vir est humanus et doctus, non videtur omnino con<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>temnendus.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Interim ecclesia et incolumitas <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ecclesiae rebus praeferenda est omnibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Doleo vicem <persName>A[mbrosi<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>i]</persName><note type="misc">A... viell</note>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><persName>A[mbrosii]</persName> (<persName>Martini?</persName>); sed quia is talis est, prodest erupisse ulcus<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Simile evenit nobis <placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>, ut scis, cum <persName>Fuli<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ginosi</persName> filia nuberet <persName ref="p8354">Frölichio</persName>, militum duci;<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="1"><persName ref="p4857">Wilhelm Frölich</persName> heiratete ca. 1545 <persName ref="p20084">Anna Rahn</persName> (vgl. <hi>Keller-Escher,</hi> Die Familie Rahn von <placeName ref="l587">Zürich)</placeName>, aber vielleicht ist jemand anderer gemeint. Schieß löst Fuliginosus im Register mit "Röichli" auf. Das Dürsteler-Register zu den Zürcher Kirchenbüchern enthält weder zu Frölich noch zu Röichli einen passenden Eintrag.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>scis, quam graves inimicitias illi contra nos ex<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ercuerint, quod pro concionibus sacris factum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>parentis damnaremus hortaremurque, ne quis <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>inde offenderetur.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Prudenter tamen et moderate, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quam fieri potuit, egimus, quod egimus, ne forte <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>mederi vellemus et plus detrimenti daremus <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ecclesiae.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Tu quoque rationem habebis ecclesiae et aedificationis <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>et pro huius commoditate opportune <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>importune ages.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Orandus imprimis dominus, ut is sit <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>in ore nostro et verba nostra dirigat ad gloriam <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>nominis eius et incolumitatem animarum.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Tur<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>cicam classem discessisse cuperem; si quid de ea <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>certius habueris, communicabis.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Pro istis, quae de<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>disti, ago gratias maximas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis quoque virum a<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>mplissimum d. a <persName>Cambray</persName> et illi me commendabis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Audimus <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>hic quoque exercitum utrumque in vicinia conse<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>disse et <persName>Philippi</persName> laborare commeatus inopia ideoque <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>fervidius quaerere pugnandi occasionem.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Fama est, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>pro certo non refero, duodecim naves onerarias <lb xml:id="p1z32"/><placeName>Gallicas</placeName> voluisse in <placeName>Caletum</placeName> inferre annonam et <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>pulverem bombardicum; ex his ab <lb xml:id="p1z35"/><placeName ref="l830">Anglica</placeName> classe duas esse demersas, 10 captas.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> superioribus diebus magna fuit concertatio, quod <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>ministri <placeName ref="l280">Lausanenses</placeName> voluerunt sibi dari excommunication<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>em et plurima huius generis.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Senatus eis restitit; <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>tandem sequestres se interposuere ministri <lb xml:id="p1z40"/><placeName ref="l41">Bernenses</placeName>, ut cum bona gratia <placeName ref="l280">Lausanenses</placeName> domum <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>redierint.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Semper aliquid turbarum est etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 26. augusti 1558.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z43"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tu<lb xml:id="p1z44"/>us.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Non relegi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Pos<lb xml:id="p1z45"/>t dies 8, <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>hoc est proxima die Veneris, si <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>potes, alique<lb xml:id="p1z48"/>m ad me ex mercatoribus vestris v<lb xml:id="p1z49"/>enire iubeas.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Dabo ei duos <lb xml:id="p1z50"/>libros, alterum pro te, alt<lb xml:id="p1z51"/>erum pro <persName>Philippo</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Prodit iam; nondum autem h<lb xml:id="p1z52"/>abeo exempla; alioqui n<lb xml:id="p1z53"/>unc mittere<lb xml:id="p1z54"/>m.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8009">Io<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>anni Fabritio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiae fideli ministro, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>domino suo et fratri <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>atque compatri dilectissimo.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
